{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1111305001:0":{"text":"엇, 이 누나 왜 이렇게 다친 거예요? 얼른 지혈해야겠어요! 우리 집에 약초가 있어요!","source_cn":"哎呀，这位大姐姐怎么受伤了？得赶快止血才行！我家有草药！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1D28889085AECCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111305002:0":{"text":"고마워, 정말 착한 아이구나...","source_cn":"谢谢，你真是个善良的孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F85A7E037A96066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111305003:0":{"text":"어라, 엄마가 약초를 어디에 두셨지? 잠시만요, 얼른 찾아볼게요.","source_cn":"咦，妈妈把草药放哪了？我得好好找一找。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BF23BBB1AA9BA02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111305004:0":{"text":"음... 어디 있지...","source_cn":"嗯……到底在哪呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7170223E6A6B8250","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111305005:0":{"text":"안 되겠어요... 엄마도 안 계시고 집이 난장판이라서 도저히 어디 있는지 못 찾겠어요...","source_cn":"不行啊……妈妈不在，家里乱糟糟的，什么都找不到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5802EC861AF3B5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111305006:0":{"text":"치피랑 같네요. 돌리가 안 치워주면 치피의 방은 발 디딜 틈도 없거든요.","source_cn":"和满满一样嘛，要不是多莉经常帮忙收拾，满满的房间连个落...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A250192CFE61E98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111305007:0":{"text":"쳇! 해미 방도 그렇잖아? 방 전체가 마법 포션으로 가득하면서!","source_cn":"你的房间不也一样吗？魔法药剂堆得到处都是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0562A3426CB4B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111305008:1":{"text":"어쩔 수 없어... 난 햄스터잖아?","source_cn":"没办法……谁叫我是一只仓鼠呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA94E247D379CFA3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111305009:1":{"text":"꼬마 아가씨, 조급해하지 마요. 우리가 도와줄게요.","source_cn":"小朋友，你不要着急，我们来帮你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C83141E3A29C144","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111305010:1":{"text":"마스터에게 맡길게요! 전에 돌리가 정리 정돈하는 법을 가르쳐 드렸다고 들었어욥!","source_cn":"梅林！交给你啦，多莉说她曾经教过你如何整理。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x47F7C4A71BE0D516","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마스터에게 맡길게요! 전에 돌리가 정리 정돈하는 법을 가르쳐 드렸다고 들었어욥!","female":"마스터에게 맡길게요! 전에 돌리가 정리 정돈하는 법을 가르쳐 드렸다고 들었어욥!","variant_male_record_index":"123894","variant_female_record_index":"123895","document